pinyon-shift-fh1-render-test-v1
# clock-hz 60
# FB-3.4 (#401): rebind a key from SETTINGS > CONTROLS. X takes Space, a
# prompt on Y is cancelled with Escape, and the guest gets its input back.
# Afterwards the run's config holds keybind_x = "Space" and keybind_y keeps
# its value.
input 0 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 360 1000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 366 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 480 1000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 486 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 600 1000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 606 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 720 1000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 726 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
capture 1200 free-roam
hostkey 1300 f6
hostkey 1330 down
hostkey 1350 down
hostkey 1370 down
hostkey 1390 down
hostkey 1410 enter
hostkey 1450 down
hostkey 1470 down
hostkey 1490 down
hostkey 1510 down
hostkey 1530 down
hostkey 1550 down
hostkey 1570 down
hostkey 1590 enter
capture 1620 prompt
hostkey 1650 space
capture 1690 controls
hostkey 1720 down
hostkey 1740 enter
hostkey 1780 escape
capture 1810 cancelled
hostkey 1840 escape
hostkey 1870 escape
capture 1970 after
stop 2030
